(text "05 | SHT4x, float and two 4-wire fans (no tachometers)" (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "42eaaf4c-6f67-52e4-b04b-c712c2b35cee"))
(text "Both fans combined <= 10 W at 12 V; combined fuse F401 2 A on the 12 V side. Start currents not measured.\nFan PWM = open drain, 25 kHz. MCU HIGH pulls fan PWM LOW: invert firmware duty. Reset / Hi-Z opens the PWM MOSFET: full speed while +12V is present.\nFan tachometer outputs are NOT connected (owner decision 24.10.2026): header pin 3 is NC, GPIO34/35 only have the 10k pull-ups R206/R207 on the MCU sheet, no ESDA6V1L.\nJ411/J421 fan headers: 1 GND, 2 +12 V, 3 tach (NC), 4 PWM. J401 SHT4x: 1 +3V3, 2 GND, 3 SDA, 4 SCL; U401 USBLC6 on SDA/SCL.\nThe float input has no USBLC6 (EU-0.1 U402 is dropped to save 0.67 EUR): 1k series + 100n + 10k pull-up only. J403 closed -> GPIO14 LOW." (at 12.7 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top)) (uuid "87144091-1149-5f44-91d2-ccaac8c929ed"))
(symbol (lib_id "EU_LITE:J4") (at 45.72 144.78 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "b51c2670-bf28-5757-a3f4-9a901de799cc")
